  "description": "A custom Unix shell implementation developed for a systems programming course using pre-1.0 Rust and direct libc bindings. It bypasses higher-level standard library abstractions to manually manage process lifecycles via fork/exec, handle POSIX signals, and implement I/O redirection and job control.",
